.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.md
!README.md
# The worker reads SYSTEM_PROMPT.md at startup and would silently fall back to
# a one-line identity without it; the skill corpus under .claude/skills/ is
# nested, so the root-level *.md rule does not touch it.
!SYSTEM_PROMPT.md